SUMMARY
Extended hunt engagement requiring sustained, structured analysis. Tests whether hunters can maintain methodological discipline across a long, complex investigation — mirroring real hunt engagements that span multiple sessions.

LEARNING OBJECTIVES
- Pivot on data using Storm and Synapse, learning how to lift, filter, and pivot.
- Learn how to label nodes to form an analytical layer.
- Use multiple data sets to answer targeted questions.
- Investigate cyber activity in logs, including:
  - Email
  - Web traffic
  - Server logs
- Use multiple techniques to track the activity of APTs (Advanced Persistent Threats).
- Use third-party data sets to discover insights about your attackers.
- Make recommendations on actions a company can take to protect itself.

SOURCE
https://kc7cyber.com/challenges/109


